            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.18.0</h2>
<h3>Skins & UI</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Gazette MK II (WSJ / NY Times broadsheet redesign)</strong>: Rebuilt Gazette as an adaptive Morning Edition (<code>#FAF8F3</code> warm newsprint) and Evening Edition (<code>#141311</code> dark newsprint) broadsheet with <code>Baskerville</code> mastheads, <code>Georgia</code> bold numerals and italic status decks, and condensed <code>Archivo Narrow</code> datelines, kickers, and tabular metadata.</li>
<li><strong>Full Gazette skin chrome & readability fixes</strong>: Migrated tabs, panels, chips, action rows, section kickers, and the Resets schedule into <code>GazetteSkin</code> — eliminating rainbow ribbons, indented black headers, clipped folio dates, and the hidden icon on the selected Overview tab, while adding click-to-provider navigation on Overview rows, regional <code>INTL</code>/<code>CN</code> stacking, inverted-contrast tab icons, and deduplicated <code>Next reset | Banked</code> columns.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
